### **5.5. ESSO Optimizer**

**Simulated Annealing with Entanglement**:[1]
```zig
pub fn optimize(self: *Self, graph: *Graph, iterations: usize) !void {
    var temperature = self.initial_temp;
    var current_energy = self.computeEnergy(graph);

    for (0..iterations) |iter| {
        // Random perturbation
        const neighbor = try self.perturb(graph);
        const neighbor_energy = self.computeEnergy(&neighbor);

        const delta_E = neighbor_energy - current_energy;

        // Acceptance probability
        const accept_prob = if (delta_E < 0) 1.0 else @exp(-delta_E / temperature);

        if (self.rng.float(f64) < accept_prob) {
            graph.* = neighbor;
            current_energy = neighbor_energy;
        }

        // Cooling schedule
        temperature *= self.cooling_rate;

        // Reheating (avoid local minima)
        if (iter % self.reheat_interval == 0) {
            temperature = @min(temperature * 1.5, self.initial_temp);
        }
    }
}
```

**Energy Function**:[1]
\[ E = E_{\text{graph}} + \lambda \cdot E_{\text{symmetry}} + \mu \cdot E_{\text{entanglement}} \]
- \(E_{\text{graph}}\): Base objective (connectivity, fractal dim)
- \(E_{\text{symmetry}}\): Penalty for breaking graph automorphisms
- \(E_{\text{entanglement}}\): Penalty for separating entangled nodes

