### **6.1. Distributed GPU Coordination**

**NCCL Allreduce**:[1]
```zig
pub fn allreduceGradients(self: *Coordinator, gradients: []f32) !void {
    const result = nccl.ncclAllReduce(
        gradients.ptr,
        gradients.ptr,
        gradients.len,
        .ncclFloat32,
        .ncclSum,
        self.comm,
        self.stream
    );
    if (result != .ncclSuccess) return error.NCCLError;
    try cudaStreamSynchronize(self.stream);
}
```

**Multi-GPU Training Loop**:[1]
```zig
pub fn trainDistributed(self: *Trainer, epochs: usize) !void {
    for (0..epochs) |epoch| {
        // 1. Shard dataset across GPUs
        const local_batch = self.dataset.getShard(self.rank, self.world_size);

        // 2. Forward pass (local GPU)
        const loss = try self.model.forward(local_batch);

        // 3. Backward pass (local gradients)
        try self.model.backward(loss);

        // 4. Allreduce gradients (synchronize)
        try self.coordinator.allreduceGradients(self.model.gradients);

        // 5. Optimizer update
        try self.optimizer.step();

        // 6. Barrier (all ranks wait)
        try self.coordinator.barrier();
    }
}
```

### **6.2. Futhark GPU Kernels**

**Matrix Multiply Kernel**:[1]
```futhark
let matmul [n][m][p] (A: [n][m]f32) (B: [m][p]f32) : [n][p]f32 =
  map (\row ->
    map (\col ->
      reduce (+) 0f32 (map2 (*) row col)
    ) (transpose B)
  ) A
```
- **Parallelization**: Outer `map` → row-wise parallelism, inner `map` → column-wise
- **Compilation**: `futhark opencl` → generates OpenCL kernels

